  "Watch the last nineteen miles.",
  "From Salem, the train runs east, at between nineteen and forty-five miles an hour.",
  "Between the detectors, nothing measures the bearing.",
  "Nineteen miles of track, and nothing reads it.",
  "Milepost forty-nine point eight one.",
  "Two hundred and fifty-three degrees, the top of the scale.",
